Hybrid book recommendation system 

A Python-based book recommendation system that combines **K-Means clustering** and **Collaborative Filtering** to provide personalized book suggestions.

📂 Repository Structure
Hybrid-Book-Recommendation-System/
│
├── README.md
├── Untitled10.ipynb
├── books.csv
└── ratings.csv

🔹 Features
- User-Based Collaborative Filtering
- K-Means Clustering
- Hybrid Recommendation
- Interactive
- Scalable

🛠 Installation
git clone https://github.com/801NITHU2213/Hybrid-Book-Recommendation-System-Python-K-Means-Collaborative-Filtering.git
cd Hybrid-Book-Recommendation-System-Python-K-Means-Collaborative-Filtering
pip install -r requirements.txt

⚡ Usage
Open `Untitled10.ipynb` in Jupyter Notebook or Colab and run the cells step by step.
